 {
  "name": "over_alpha_exact",
  "file": "over_alpha_exact.png",
  "writer": "hand-assembled",
  "notes": "APNG_BLEND_OP_OVER restricted to the degenerate cases, which are exact under any rounding: half-transparent green over the empty canvas must come back verbatim (source-over onto a transparent destination is the identity), a 0/255 alpha checkerboard must punch holes rather than blend, and an opaque rectangle over the half-transparent one must overwrite it; Pillow composites APNG_BLEND_OP_OVER as a straight lerp that also lerps alpha, so it disagrees with the specification wherever a source pixel is partly transparent",
  "sha256": "5374d2e23550ed1c",
  "size": 376,
